      "trackName": "Pong 360° - Retro Watch Arcade",
      "description": "Experience the classic arcade excitement reinvention specifically for Apple Watch.\n\nPong 360° takes the legendary ping pong mechanics and wraps them into a circular survival challenge. Control your paddle arc, deflect the ball, and survive as long as you can against increasing speeds and chaotic modifiers.\n\nWhy You'll Love It:\nBuilt for Watch: Optimized specifically for the wrist with native Digital Crown support for precise 360° control.\nPick Up & Play: Launches instantly. Perfect for 30-second bursts while waiting in line or commuting.\nPower-Up Mayhem: Unlock exciting bonuses like Multi-Ball, Mega-Paddle, and Shields. Avoid tricky \"Gotcha\" traps that shrink your defense or speed up the game.\nBattery Friendly: High-contrast OLED graphics (True Black) look stunning and consume minimal power, so you can play without draining your day.\nPure Retro Vibes: Nostalgic sound effects and clean, arcade visuals that respect the classics.\n\nNo phone required. Install directly on your watch and start the challenge today!",
